				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>Hozumi追加0612
Ariizumi修正0612
次にMSG_MB_CHILD_07が出るため
最後の1行を削除</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:22" />
		</CommentCell>
